          "direction": "max",
          "maintenance": true,
          "text": "As required pursuant to Section 5.04(a) of the Agreement, the Borrower’s ratio (the “Leverage Ratio”) of CFSC Consolidated Debt to CFSC’s Consolidated Net Worth, equal to the average of the Leverage Ratios as determined on the last day of each of the six preceding calendar months, as of the end of the accounting period covered by the attached financial statements, is not greater than 10.0 to 1, as shown below. [34] a"
        },
        {
          "type": "net_worth",
          "limit": 9000000000.0,
          "unit": "usd",
          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": true,
          "text": "As required pursuant to Section 5.03 of the Agreement, the Borrower’s Consolidated Net Worth, as of the end of the accounting period covered by the attached financial statements, is at least $9,000,000,000 as shown below. a."
        },
        {
          "type": "leverage",
          "limit": 10.0,
          "unit": "x",
          "direction": "max",
          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "(i) Maintain at all times a ratio (the “ Leverage Ratio ”) of (x) CFSC Consolidated Debt to (y) CFSC’s Consolidated Net Worth of not greater than 10.0 to 1."
        },
        {
          "type": "net_worth",
          "limit": 9000000000.0,
          "unit": "usd",
          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "So long as any Advance shall remain unpaid or any Bank shall have any Commitment hereunder, Caterpillar will, unless the Majority Banks shall otherwise consent in writing, maintain at all times during each fiscal year of Caterpillar, Consolidated Net Worth of not less than $9,000,000,000."
        },
        {
